OL,3,GNEWSACrossing hope near schools dashed
OL,4,Aby council error
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school said it was delighted to find
OL,7,Fout it was getting a new road crossing
OL,8,Fnearby, only to discover the council
OL,9,Fdocuments were wrong.
OL,11,FConcerns were raised by parents about
OL,12,Fsafety on Maple Grove in March,
OL,13,FCambridgeshire, outside Westwood
OL,14,FPrimary School and Maple Grove
OL,15,FPre-School.
OL,17,FCambridgeshire County Council documents
OL,18,Fsaid a crossing would "be delivered as
OL,19,Fpart of the road resurfacing programme
OL,20,Foutside Westwood School", but the
OL,21,Fauthority later confirmed its agenda
OL,22,F"contained errors".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
