OL,3,GNEWSACrossing hope near schools dashed
OL,4,Aby council error
OL,5,
OL,6,FLauren Read, principal of the primary
OL,7,Fschool, said: "We were delighted last
OL,8,Fweek when we heard the news that we
OL,9,Fwere getting a crossing, so this week
OL,10,Fit feels like the rug has been pulled
OL,11,Ffrom under our feet."
